*
* Execute robot framework tests using cli:
*
# robot MyFirstTest.robot

*
* Start http server serving the login.html page
*
# cd <cd to folder where login.html is>
# python3 -m http.server
Open browser and insert this url: http://8000/login.html
Login web page is visible

*
* Use TAGS in robot framework
* *** Test Cases ***
* Login test
*     [Tags]    Smoke
*     Open Browser    browser=${BROWSER}    url=${URL}
*
# robot --include smoke test_file.robot

*
* Select tests by name or by long name containing
*
# robot -t *requests* test_file.robot 
